WEBVTT


00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:01.000
This message is for you,

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:02.520
no matter how fast you go,

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:04.160
the important thing is to reach the goal.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.600
When I started I was comparing myself and you have to understand something.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:08.880
Competition is evidence that you can too,

00:00:08.881 --> 00:00:10.761
but you don't have to do it with sacrifice

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:12.360
and the pace and speed of others.

00:00:12.361 --> 00:00:14.161
You have to do it the way you feel comfortable,

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.240
because at the end of the day

00:00:15.241 --> 00:00:18.041
the important thing is to reach the goal and stay at the goal.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.120
and not go up and down
